### 3.9 业务侧：Runner + 任务方法

每个要动态调度的任务，需要两样东西：

**① 任务方法**（打注解），例：
[OrderServiceImpl.java](file:///d:/study/my-workspace/wechat-workspace/e-commerce-boot/order-service/src/main/java/ecommerce/order/service/impl/OrderServiceImpl.java)

```java
/** 超时关闭待付款订单：执行周期由后台动态任务配置控制，默认每分钟一次 */
@Transactional
@MonitoredTask(name = "closeExpiredOrders", description = "超时关闭待付款订单并恢复库存",
        cron = "每 60 秒")
public void sweepExpiredPendingPayOrders() { ... }
```

**② Runner 实现**（暴露给调度器），例：
[CloseExpiredOrdersTaskRunner.java](file:///d:/study/my-workspace/wechat-workspace/e-commerce-boot/order-service/src/main/java/ecommerce/order/service/CloseExpiredOrdersTaskRunner.java)

```java
@Component
public class CloseExpiredOrdersTaskRunner implements MonitoredTaskRunner {

    private final OrderService orderService;

    public CloseExpiredOrdersTaskRunner(OrderService orderService) {
        this.orderService = orderService;
    }

    @Override
    public String taskName() {
        return "closeExpiredOrders";   // 必须和 @MonitoredTask.name() 一致
    }

    @Override
    public void run() {
        orderService.sweepExpiredPendingPayOrders();
    }
}
```

**约定**：`taskName()` == `@MonitoredTask.name()` == 数据库 `admin_monitor_task.task_name`，三处必须一致，否则任务不会被调度。

### 3.10 monitor-service：配置与手动触发中心

[TaskMonitorService.java](file:///d:/study/my-workspace/wechat-workspace/e-commerce-boot/monitor-service/src/main/java/ecommerce/monitor/service/TaskMonitorService.java)

monitor-service 本身**不调度任务**，只负责：
- 任务配置的增删改查（`admin_monitor_task` 表）
- 执行日志查询（`admin_monitor_task_log` 表）
- 手动触发转发

**手动触发转发逻辑**（跨服务调用）：

```java
private static final List<String> MANUAL_RUN_ALLOWED = List.of("logCleanup");

public Map<String, Object> run(String name, String authorization) {
    Map<String, Object> task = findByName(name);
    if (!MANUAL_RUN_ALLOWED.contains(name)) {
        throw new BusinessException(HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST,
                "该任务未开放手动执行（避免重复通知/批量改单等风险）");
    }
    String service = String.valueOf(task.get("service"));   // task_group = 归属服务
    ServiceInstance instance = resolveInstance(service);       // Nacos 找实例
    String url = "http://" + instance.getHost() + ":" + instance.getPort()
            + "/api/admin/tasks/" + name + "/run";
    restClient.post().uri(url)
            .header("Authorization", authorization == null ? "" : authorization)
            .retrieve().toBodilessEntity();
    ...
}
```

**白名单机制**：`MANUAL_RUN_ALLOWED` 只放开 `logCleanup`（幂等、低风险）。
关单、消息通知这类任务**不开放手动执行**，避免重复推送或批量改单。

**cron 校验**（后台新增任务时）：

```java
private void validateSchedule(int taskType, String value) {
    if (taskType == 1) {
        try {
            CronExpression.parse(value);
        } catch (RuntimeException e) {
            throw new BusinessException(HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST, "cron 表达式非法: " + value);
        }
        return;
    }
    try {
        long millis = Long.parseLong(value);
        if (millis < 1000) {
            throw new BusinessException(HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST, "间隔不能小于 1000 毫秒");
        }
    } catch (NumberFormatException e) {
        throw new BusinessException(HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST, "间隔必须是毫秒数: " + value);
    }
}
```

