### 5.1 日志清理任务的两个设计细节

[LogCleanupTask.java](file:///d:/study/my-workspace/wechat-workspace/e-commerce-boot/auth-service/src/main/java/ecommerce/auth/service/LogCleanupTask.java)

**① 时区**：DB 服务器是 UTC，`NOW()` 比本地时间早 8 小时，所以阈值由 Java 算好再传 SQL：

```java
LocalDateTime before = LocalDateTime.now().minusDays(RETAIN_DAYS);
```

**② 分批删除**：一次性 DELETE 几万行会长时间锁表，把线上查询接口拖住。每批 1000 行，删完一批释放一批：

```java
private int deleteInBatches(IntSupplier deleter) {
    int total = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < MAX_BATCHES; i++) {   // MAX_BATCHES = 200，最多 20 万行
        int deleted = deleter.getAsInt();
        total += deleted;
        if (deleted < BATCH_SIZE) {           // 删不满一批说明到底了
            return total;
        }
    }
    log.warn("日志清理达到批次上限 {}，剩余部分留到下次任务处理", MAX_BATCHES);
    return total;
}
```

